+---
+id: task-002-track-task-creation-and-update-times
+type: task
+title: "Track task creation and update times"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Tasks expose ISO-8601 `createdAt` and `updatedAt` timestamps. Creation sets both to the same time;
+every successful task change (complete, reopen, rename, tag, untag) refreshes `updatedAt`. Keep
+time generation injectable in the domain for deterministic behavior.
